+	/// (<c>OptimumTryPlanUpscaleRenderSize</c>) and rebuilds every target from the
+	/// answer, so switching off restores the pre-upscaler chain - the in-house TAA
+	/// resolve, its history slots, the sharpen pass and the FSR 1 blit - on that
+	/// same rebuild.
+	///
